---
---

<div class="section bordered">
  <div class="narrow center">
    <div class="eyebrow muted">The problem</div>
    <div class="h2">Most workout plans assume you'll feel fine.</div>
    <div class="stack-lines">
      <div>Some days you have plenty of energy.</div>
      <div>Some days you're exhausted.</div>
      <div>Sometimes something hurts.</div>
      <div>Sometimes you only have 20 minutes.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="divider-block">
      <div class="struck">Traditional plans tell you what you should do.</div>
      <div class="punch">Personal-TrAIner adapts to what you can actually do today.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .section.bordered {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .eyebrow.muted {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h2 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .stack-lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .divider-block {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.1);
    padding-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .struck {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.35);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.2);
  }

  .punch {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
